\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qKW0jVOqSiis3kRgN5b4VZekbLx.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-09-16\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Happy Ending\",\"overview\":\"The friends help Naira and Bagga keep the long-distance spark alive while surprising sparks fly on the side for Dipika and Karan as romance knocks on their doors too.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ZKu9AS1yTX5AQhA8U9qnA5fH8g.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-16\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"No More Secrets\",\"overview\":\"The bond of friendship is tested as the group pursues the mystery of Bagga's infidelity. Secrets about Naira, Dhatrapriya, and Karan are revealed even as Dipika finds herself a surprising new admirer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qL2VrXHjaZhOFs3J6ldHErW22CI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-16\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Loser\",\"overview\":\"The game of one-upmanship between the seniors and juniors ends in a lavish party where danger lurks. As music and romance soar, betrayal strikes.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fj2Vyy1juwrCuZkQDdYQjArImt8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-16\",\"runtime\":31},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Beer and Whiskey\",\"overview\":\"New lovers create a huge scandal for Dipika that puts Naira’s relationship with Bagga to the test. Karan and Dhatrapriya struggle to make a milestone happen.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2pGqR5tPLCrCHzgNmHcW5lWjMmq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-16\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Problem Kya Hai?\",\"overview\":\"Bagga’s unexpected stand is met with huge resistance by Naira. Dhatrapriya battles romantic insecurities. As the friend's rally to support Dipika, they must make an important ideological choice.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5k5kyn2clpb4VeYMGBknsfcIGfD.